diff --git a/vendor/README.md b/vendor/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..c6bd7a0
--- /dev/null
+++ b/vendor/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+# Hovercard compatibility
+
+These browser-only polyfills are vendored so previews do not depend on a CDN at
+runtime. `index.html` feature-detects each API before loading its polyfill.
+
+- `interestfor/interestfor.min.js`: `interestfor` 1.0.14, from
+  https://unpkg.com/interestfor@1.0.14/src/interestfor.min.js
+- `popover-polyfill/popover.min.js`: `@oddbird/popover-polyfill` 0.7.3, from
+  https://unpkg.com/@oddbird/popover-polyfill@0.7.3/dist/popover.min.js
+
+Each directory includes the upstream BSD-3-Clause license.
